        <activityName xml:lang="en">Brick, market mix, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Brick, market mix, at regional storage
pipeline transport is modelled as freight train transport.;
UUID: ddfce4a2-9639-37fa-b421-7a506f03cf1f
This data set accounts for 1 kg of bricks at the regional storage. 9% are from import, 91% are produced in Switzerland. The imported share is weighted with a factor of 1.1. The imported goods are delievered to Switzerland to 47% from Germany, 28% from Italy 22% from Austria and 2% from Belgium. 1% is delievered by boat, 4% are delievered by freight train and 98% by lorry. The average import distance is 687 km.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: undefined
Time period: undefined
Production volume: CH consumption of roof tiles and bricks: 842 kt
Sampling: statistical data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ddfce4a2-9639-37fa-b421-7a506f03cf1f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
